 the stream.\"\n  :type 'integer\n  :safe #'integerp\n  :group 'iar)\n\n(defcustom iar-request-total-timeout 900\n  \"Seconds without ANY data before aborting a request.\nCovers non-streaming requests (never call the filter) and the\nprompt-eval window before the first token of a streaming request.\nnil disables the total check.\"\n  :type '(choice (integer :tag \"Seconds\")\n                 (const :tag \"Disabled\" nil))\n  :safe #'iar--positive-integer-or-nil-p\n  :group 'iar)\n\n;; =============================================================================\n;; Malformed Tool Call Feedback Parameters (Track A2)\n;; =============================================================================\n\n(defcustom iar-malformed-args-feedback t\n  \"When non-nil, wrap tool functions with structured error feedback.\nWrong argument shapes then return '<tool_call_error>' messages with\nthe expected spec and received values, instead of raw elisp error\nstrings the model cannot learn from.\nSet to nil for raw gptel behavior (not recommended).\"\n  :type 'boolean\n  :safe #'booleanp\n  :group 'iar)\n\n;; =============================================================================\n;; Request Log Parameters (Track A4 -- the witness)\n;; =============================================================================\n=== model in info ===\n114:         (model (when info (plist-get info :model))))\n\n[t+11:50/60:00 c12/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_qhzu6lfb","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/i.ar && timeout 20 grep -n \"thinking-loop\" emacs.d/init.d/tool-call/iar-thinking-loop-guard.el | head -3; timeout 20 ls test/ | grep -i think; echo \"---suite runner---\"; timeout 20 ls test/*.el 2>/dev/null | head; timeout 20 grep -rn \"iar--thinking-loop\" test/ 2>/dev/null | grep -i \"ert\\|deftest\" | head"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[03:24:10] 48:(defvar iar-thinking-loop-guard-enabled nil\n49:  \