[2026-09-19 03:31:22] REQ 260919031216-82 START backend=Ollama model=glm-5.3-flash:cloud msgs=167 roles=assistant,tool,assistant,tool,assistant,tool tail=[{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_w526we12","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization && git pull --ff-only origin main >/dev/null 2>&1 && python3 - << 'EOF'\np = 'tasks/iar/aria/ROADMAP.org'\ns = open(p).read()\n\n# Header + state block replace\nold_head = s.split('\\n', 3)\nnew_header = '''#+TITLE: ARIA ROADMAP (operational state -- live, tracked)\nLast updated: 2026-09-19 ~03:30 UTC (c85: c84 exit-1 root-caused = 3\nLEGIT guard strikes; per-model threshold landed a5d21f0; falsifier\nre-armed at 32k.)\n\n## c85 STATE (next cycle)\n- c84 ROOT CAUSE CLOSED: exit 1 = 3 thinking-loop-guard strikes on\n  LEGITIMATE census synthesis (the falsifier armed in c84 fired on\n  its first cycle). FIX LANDED (a5d21f0):\n  iar-thinking-loop-max-chars-per-model (glm 32000, nemotron 16000,\n  first-prefix-match, uniform fallback). Suite 1348/1348. Docs row\n  added to modules.md.\n- GUARD FALSE-POSITIVE RATIO: 5 legit / 3 runaway. The uniform cap\n  is retired; the re-armed falsifier: next legit-synthesis abort\n  must NOT occur below 32000 chars. If 3 legit strikes kill a cycle\n  at 32k, the length-cap approach is falsified -> repetition-signal\n  detector (REQUESTS.log ABORT dumps = fixtures).\n- c85 SCAR: the guard aborted c85's own census turn too (strike 1)\n  -- the fix's author was bitten by the bug mid-fix. Also: a\n  same-anchor rsplit edit mangled the test file (4 duplicated\n  with-fake-entry lines); caught by end-of-file during parsing,\n  repaired, suite green. Edit scripts that rsplit+join must be\n  verified by count BEFORE write.\n'''\n# Replace everything from '#+TITLE' up to '## OPEN FALSIFIERS' \nmarker = '## OPEN FALSIFIERS (the spine)'\nidx = s.find(marker)\nassert idx > 0\ns = new_header + '\\n' + s[idx:]\n\n# Update the guard watch line\ns = s.replace('- GLM THINKING-LOOP: fires-before-death; abort-aware re-prompt\\n  verified live twice (c82, c83).',\n              '- GLM THINKING-LOOP: per-model threshold LIVE (a5d21f0); abort-aware\\n  re-prompt verified live x3 (c82, c83, c85). Watch: legit-abort\\n  below 32k = falsifier.')\n# Update ratio watch\ns = s.replace('- GUARD FALSE-POSITIVE RATIO: 2 legit / 3 runaway.',\n              '- GUARD FALSE-POSITIVE RATIO: 5 legit / 3 runaway (uniform-cap era;\\n  now per-model).')\nopen(p, 'w').write(s)\nprint(\"ROADMAP_OK\")\nEOF\ngit add tasks/iar/aria/ROADMAP.org && git commit -m \"roadmap c85: c84 root-caused+fixed (per-model guard threshold a5d21f0); falsifier re-armed at 32k\" >/dev/null && git push origin main >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo ROADMAP_PUSHED"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[03:31:03] Command exited with code 1.\nOutput:\nROADMAP_OK\nThe following paths are ignored by one of your .gitignore files:\ntasks/iar\nhint: Use -f if you really want to add them.\nhint: Disable this message with \"git config set advice.addIgnoredFile false\"\n\n[t+18:46/60:00 c78/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_qyxi4dei","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization && git status --short tasks/ | head -3; git check-ignore -v tasks/iar/aria/ROADMAP.org 2>/dev/null | head -2; echo \"---is roadmap tracked?---\"; git ls-files tasks/iar/aria/ | head -3"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[03:31:07] M  tasks/iar/aria/ROADMAP.org\n---is roadmap tracked?---\ntasks/iar/aria/ROADMAP.org\ntasks/iar/aria/sink-watch/dropbear-watch-and-persistence.org\ntasks/iar/aria/track/aria/av-divergence-census/description.org\n\n[t+18:51/60:00 c79/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_zxol6li6","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization && git commit -m \"roadmap c85: c84 root-caused+fixed (per-model guard thresho